: [{"op": "systemResult", "result": "denied"}, {"op": "request"}],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "denied", "showedRationale": true, "openSettingsGuide": false},\n      "note": "BR-TEXT-14：push 的用途键是 perm.push.card_hint，不是拼接得到的 perm.push.purpose。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "already_granted",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "granted"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "granted", "showedRationale": false, "openSettingsGuide": false},\n      "note": "03 §4.9：第二次查询到已授权直接返回；expect 中 UI 标志只描述最后一次 request。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "denied_before_48_hours",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 172799999},\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "granted"},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "throttled", "showedRationale": false, "openSettingsGuide": true},\n      "note": "BR-ID-13：距拒绝尚差 1 毫秒满 48 小时，不再申请；advance 后重建组件，验证节流记录持久化。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "denied_exactly_48_hours",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 172800000},\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "granted"},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "granted", "showedRationale": true, "openSettingsGuide": false},\n      "note": "BR-ID-13：已满 48 小时，不再处于 48 小时内；本例是用户再次保存图片。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "denied_after_48_hours",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 172800001},\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "granted"},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "granted", "showedRationale": true, "openSettingsGuide": false},\n      "note": "BR-ID-13：超过 48 小时后可在对应功能入口再次申请。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "throttled_click_does_not_move_denial_time",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 86400000},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 86400000},\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "granted"},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "granted", "showedRationale": true, "openSettingsGuide": false},\n      "note": "03 §4.9 记录的是上次被拒的时刻；被节流的点击没有再次申请、没有新的系统拒绝，不能延长窗口。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "photos_permanently_denied",\n      "permission": "photos",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "permanently_denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 172800001},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "permanently_denied", "showedRationale": false, "openSettingsGuide": true},\n      "note": "03 §4.9：系统仍报告永久拒绝时，即使超过节流期也不重复申请；显示 perm.photos.denied_forever 与 perm.go_settings。"\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "push_permanently_denied",\n      "permission": "push",\n      "steps": [\n        {"op": "systemResult", "result": "permanently_denied"},\n        {"op": "request"},\n        {"op": "advance", "millis": 172800001},\n        {"op": "request"}\n      ],\n      "expect": {"resultRaw": "permanently_denied", "showedRationale": false, "openSettingsGuide": true},\n      "note": "03 §4.9、BR-TEXT-14：通知永久拒绝后使用 perm.push.denied_forever 与 perm.go_settings。"\n    }\n  ],\n  "gaps": [\n    "BR-ID-09 未给出每种设备标识的完整长度与字符集规则，device-hash.vectors.json 也明确不覆盖这些格式检查；不自造正则。reasonRaw 没有稳定枚举，不断言具体原因字符串。",\n    "device_hash 的唯一预期数据是 sources 引用的锁定向量文件；不在本文件复制哈希值。该文件含 OAID 算法向量，不代表 MVP 可以采集 OAID。完整哈希向量读取测试按 brief §0 由实现任务补齐。",\n    "9cd1e6f 的 getConfig 尚未声明 If-None-Match、ETag 或 304。客户端携带 ETag 依据 03 §4.3，304 不变依据本任务要求；缺失的服务端声明需补齐。无缓存却收到 304、无 ETag 后续请求、ETag 跨进程持久化与并发响应乱序未明确，本组不裁定。",\n    "search_status 三层均缺平台、出现 null 或未知值时的最终结果未明确；link_patterns 损坏、同版本异内容与版本回退的处理未明确。包内生产值需要由发布时生产配置生成，不能把本向量的示例当默认值。",\n    "Tracker 溢出时丢旧还是丢新、失败重试与确认协议没有明确；upperBounds 中列出的计数只做上界断言，其他计数严格相等。collected 表示 track 接受数，uploaded 表示 sink 确认成功的事件数。",\n    "events.yaml 的 user_id 是可选字段，只明确游客为空及登录后不回写原事件；不强行要求登录事件携带非空 user_id。OpenAPI 没有 /v1/events，本组只测注入 sink。",\n    "system-permissions.yaml 尚未填 Android、鸿蒙系统权限名。本组使用 push/photos 逻辑类型，不猜系统权限名。unavailable 的具体映射、说明页取消、并发申请、时钟回拨未明确，不编造结果向量。",\n    "清除缓存不得清 LKG、权限节流记录；环境切换必须清 LKG、device_id、install_secret；install_secret 只能进各端安全存储。这些规则已明确，但给定纯函数 API 没有宿主清理器、设备读取器或安全存储接线面，需要在实现任务的集成测试中验证，不能用 DeviceIdPolicy 的布尔结果冒充已经验证实际系统调用。"\n  ]\n}\n';
